# Frontend build-time configuration.
#
# When the PWA and the API live on the same origin (Docker/nginx on-prem, or the
# Vite dev proxy), leave this unset — the app calls its own origin.
#
# When hosting the PWA separately (e.g. on Vercel) with the API elsewhere
# (e.g. Render/Fly), set this to the API origin, with NO trailing slash:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-vmis-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
